<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1267].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1267&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MODIFIED PICROPHILUS MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> (NH<sub>4</sub>)<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>                                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components thoroughly, adjust pH to 2.0 - 2.5 with H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> and autoclave.  After cooling, add the following solutions (filter-sterilized):  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 10% Tryptone solution                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;11.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 10% Yeast extract solution                             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;11.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 10% Fe<sub>2</sub>(SO<sub>4</sub>)<sub>3</sub> solution (in 0.01 N H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> solution)   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;88.8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Wolfe's mineral elixir (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=470">470</a>)           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin solution (see below)                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
